<p><strong>ChattQuisitions</strong> is a brand operated by <strong>Mental Pictures LLC</strong> ("we," "us," "our"). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you visit chattquisitions.com or communicate with us, including via SMS text messaging.</p>

